    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef9161443277b1080b77a1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今年は秋めく新潟が舞台のスプリンターズステークス\\n6ハロンの熱き戦いを制し最速を証明するのは誰だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca33c1ee5cfc96bee7a07b1abec28089fa88af2c74a062cce68d8ed22f0cca9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eee88846bda3581b9f69293",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "乐章与掌声在赛马场内回荡\\n今年以仁川为舞台的是伊丽莎白女王杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d93e6990341532dd809ef79c65cb3c4e711b7089c74524cc0018afaabd94cd99",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c89bba076f498a5bc9bc12aa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "冲过仁川的坡道，第一个冲线的是\\n%h_rank1！\\n就在这阪神赛马场，制霸了伊丽莎白女王杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de672ab792357f4273580f272ea4caf3f79aa29e775504813779f11c4b3dcdca",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eba78c5118e176f6d3eb036",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "顺着外侧，%a_horse2",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a278bc3c3505e4fd891ee3a626c6f112c5b253035e6229aca579370c2ef974",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
