    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b2c5287cbcc9094078f91d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "虽然取得了一场胜利，但赛马娘们并没有懈怠\n能够突破新障碍的会是谁\n处女杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4873022d3f83c370402b7b539d95a5a8497011545cea17a8bbe51dfb69a83805",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "52"
